so please continue to give.

00:11:53.746 --> 00:11:55.681 line:0%
More and more New Yorkers
are turning to them

00:11:55.681 --> 00:11:57.215 line:0%
to keep food on their tables.

00:11:57.215 --> 00:11:59.751 line:0%
If you're watching this online,
please hit the donate button.

00:11:59.751 --> 00:12:02.054 line:0%
Stay safe, wash your hands,
we love you.

